# The foundation's images on a server (dev, prod), pinned by digest: what `latest` was when the
# template was released, so a server runs what the template tested and a pull never changes it.
# Local follows `latest` (../../versions.env). `make pin ENV=prod WRITE=1` moves these to today's
# `latest`; a project that must differ overrides a line in site/config/server/versions.env, or in
# site/config/<env>/versions.env for one environment. `make check` fails on a server image
# without a digest.

# Foundation, public on ghcr.io.
